WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.603
You may hear modern data described using the three
Vs volume velocity and variety

00:00:07.355 --> 00:00:13.489
Volume is about scale Velocity is about how quickly
data arrives or must be processed

00:00:14.397 --> 00:00:20.064
Variety is about the different forms of data This
module focuses

00:00:20.077 --> 00:00:26.605
mainly on variety But in real systems all three
interact A

00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:30.697
small JSON file and a streaming feed of millions of
JSON events may use the

00:00:30.711 --> 00:00:34.079
same format but require very different engineering
solutions
